        "Description": "差分目标系列：大祭司\rDT(Diverse Targets):The Archpriest\r\r关卡目标：\r*消灭欧贝克·纳巴佐夫，尤尔杜兹修女，瑞贝卡和杰夫\r奖励目标：\r*将三楼展览厅所有展品全部回收\r*用对应展品消灭对应目标\r*找到教派新人的服装\r*在撤离前穿回西装\r限制条件：\r*因场馆限制，你需要静悄悄完成此任务，故不能击晕任何人\r\rThe Targets:\r*Eliminate Oybek Nabazov,Sister Yulduz,Rebecca and Jeff\rBonus Targets:\r*Retrieve all exhibits in the exhibition on 3rd floor\r*Use certain exhibit to kill certain target\r*Find the disguise you need\r*Wear your suit before extract\rRestrictions:\r*Because of the exhibition,you need be quiet,so NO PACIFICATIONS",
